      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-196416\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-196416\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Normal vent sizes shall comply with the sizes listed in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-196415', hash: '#JD_MCTable1305.7(1)' }}\">Tables 1305.7(1)<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-196415', hash: '#JD_MCTable1305.7(2)' }}\">1305.7(2)<\/Link>; provided, however, for tanks other than those complying with the alternate tank design and construction standards contained in Section 1305.14, the normal vent shall not be smaller in size than the fill pipe. <\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-196417\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-196417\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_MCTable1305.7(1)\" id=\"JD_MCTable1305.7(1)\" title=\"MC Table 1305.7(1)\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 1305.7(1)<br><\/br>Vent Piping for Underground Tanks<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-196418\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-196418\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "11498-html-1",
